# Force LF for all text files; Hyperly is built on Windows + WSL and
# CRLF causes npm/vite to choke and pollutes every diff.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.webp binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary
*.mp4 binary
*.mp3 binary
*.wav binary
